# No environment variables are required to run Chessnote.
#
# The app is local-first: your scoresheets live in the browser's localStorage.
# Cross-device sync uses a GitHub personal access token + Gist ID, which are
# entered in the app UI (Gist Sync dialog) and stored only in your browser's
# localStorage — never in an env file.
#
# Optional: copy this file to `.env.local` if a future feature needs env config.
